stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CONNECTED
    CONNECTED --> CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP : heartbeat received
    CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP --> FAULT : front/rear function missing
    CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP --> FAULT : selected function != 0
    CHECKING_OUTPUT_MAP --> PREFLIGHT : map accepted
    PREFLIGHT --> FAULT : armed without --allow-armed
    PREFLIGHT --> DRY_RUN : no --send
    PREFLIGHT --> COMMANDING : --send
    COMMANDING --> STOPPING : timeout or Ctrl+C
    STOPPING --> COMPLETE : both outputs neutralized
    FAULT --> [*]
    DRY_RUN --> [*]
    COMPLETE --> [*]

    note right of FAULT
      Do not bypass the output-map check.
      Do not test with propellers connected.
      Do not command an unsecured boat.
      Do not assume the sign; verify left/right at low output.
    end note
